*> Corrigé TP4.3 : tri + rupture + récapitulatif avec pourcentages
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TP43.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT F-VENTES ASSIGN TO "seance4/data/ventes.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT F-TRIE   ASSIGN TO "seance4/out/ventes_tri.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-FS.
    SELECT F-TRI    ASSIGN TO "sortwork".

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD F-VENTES.
01 ENR-VENTE        PIC X(27).
FD F-TRIE.
01 ENR-TRIE.
   05 V-REGION      PIC X(10).
   05 V-VENDEUR     PIC X(10).
   05 V-MONTANT     PIC 9(5)V99.
SD F-TRI.
01 ENR-TRI.
   05 T-REGION      PIC X(10).
   05 T-VENDEUR     PIC X(10).
   05 T-MONTANT     PIC 9(5)V99.

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FS               PIC XX.
   88 FS-FIN                  VALUE "10".
01 WS-REGION-COURANTE  PIC X(10).
01 WS-TOTAL-REGION     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL-GENERAL    PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-NB-REGIONS       PIC 99      VALUE 0.
01 WS-I                PIC 99.
01 WS-RECAP.
   05 WS-REG-LIGNE OCCURS 10 TIMES.
      10 WS-REG-NOM    PIC X(10).
      10 WS-REG-TOTAL  PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-PCT              PIC 999V9.
01 WS-ED-MONTANT       PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
01 WS-ED-PCT           PIC ZZ9.9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-PRINCIPAL.
    SORT F-TRI
        ON ASCENDING KEY T-REGION T-VENDEUR
        USING F-VENTES
        GIVING F-TRIE

    OPEN INPUT F-TRIE
    PERFORM 1000-LIRE
    PERFORM UNTIL FS-FIN
        MOVE V-REGION TO WS-REGION-COURANTE
        MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-REGION
        PERFORM UNTIL FS-FIN OR V-REGION NOT = WS-REGION-COURANTE
            PERFORM 2000-DETAIL
            PERFORM 1000-LIRE
        END-PERFORM
        PERFORM 3000-RUPTURE-REGION
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE F-TRIE

    PERFORM 4000-RECAPITULATIF
    STOP RUN.

1000-LIRE.
    READ F-TRIE
        AT END CONTINUE
    END-READ.

2000-DETAIL.
    MOVE V-MONTANT TO WS-ED-MONTANT
    DISPLAY V-REGION " " V-VENDEUR " " WS-ED-MONTANT
    ADD V-MONTANT TO WS-TOTAL-REGION WS-TOTAL-GENERAL.

3000-RUPTURE-REGION.
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-REGION TO WS-ED-MONTANT
    DISPLAY "  Sous-total " WS-REGION-COURANTE " " WS-ED-MONTANT
    DISPLAY " "
    ADD 1 TO WS-NB-REGIONS
    MOVE WS-REGION-COURANTE TO WS-REG-NOM(WS-NB-REGIONS)
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-REGION    TO WS-REG-TOTAL(WS-NB-REGIONS).

4000-RECAPITULATIF.
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-GENERAL TO WS-ED-MONTANT
    DISPLAY "TOTAL GENERAL : " WS-ED-MONTANT
    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "REGION            TOTAL     PART"
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-NB-REGIONS
        COMPUTE WS-PCT ROUNDED =
            WS-REG-TOTAL(WS-I) / WS-TOTAL-GENERAL * 100
        MOVE WS-REG-TOTAL(WS-I) TO WS-ED-MONTANT
        MOVE WS-PCT TO WS-ED-PCT
        DISPLAY WS-REG-NOM(WS-I) " " WS-ED-MONTANT "  " WS-ED-PCT " %"
    END-PERFORM.
